{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"\"Shiny Scales get hunted for scales?\" Baeshra asks tilting her head to one side","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:15:43.100000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742310199846764565","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"“Not me personally, however some of my family have not been so lucky.” Copper keeps a steady pace while rowing, he begins to tell a story. “As a child, my parents and I lived alone. I never thought much of it, I just enjoyed being able to play. However as I got older, I began asking questions as to why we lived alone. That was when my mother and father sat me down, and told me what the world was like.” He lets out a long sigh, “there is a group of people. Truly evil beings. They consider hunting a way to show there status. At first they hunted regular animals, but after a while that got boring. Hunting a deer is one thing, but hunting something that could potentially outsmart you? That was considered the height of skill. When dragons became harder and harder to find, someone got the bright idea. My kind were essentially dragons? Are they not? It’s basically the same thing. And so they began hunting us. They thought that by hunting my kind, it would show off there status as Hunters. These Hunters were disgusting, however they did follow at least some sort of code. They never hunted a pregnant person, nor small groups. They would be to ‘easy’. Which is why my kind is spread out. The farther we are from each other, the safer we are.”","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:22:05.647000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T09:25:10.182000Z","id":"742311804365045790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
