{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Baeshra nods in interest as the story begins. But then looks down when hearing about the hunters. She relates more to the hunters than the prey. \"Shiny Scales... ever meet hunters...?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:25:22.928000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742312631821664368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
