{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Copper nods, “once. Many years ago, as a small one. There was a group of them. Turns out, they had been given some wrong information about my family. They believed there to be many of us, when in fact we only numbered 3. They came in the night, while we were sleeping. I awoke to sound of shattering glass. And my mother holding me. The door suddenly burst open, and they piled inside. Weapons drawn, ready for a fight. When they saw it was just me and my parents, they weren’t sorry. They were disappointed. They were expecting to have a fight, instead they saw my father pleading they spare my mother and I at least. The leader of the group was angry, this wasn’t the challenge he had hoped for, so he ordered his group to leave. However one of there members wasn’t satisfied. He wanted a trophy. So they held my father down, and removed one of his claws.” Copper looks out to the stars, “the next day, my father told me that we were lucky. That it could have been much worse.” He lets out a long sigh “From that day on, I swore I’d never let anyone I cared about get hurt again. And so i trained myself. I trained to fight, so I could protect those I love.”","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:31:35.556000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742314194736513084","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"Baeshra nods solemnly with the story. \"Father right. Could be much worse... could be more than one that want trophy. Could be leader that wanted trophy. Could no care about honor... but all past now. And may be good come from bad. Shiny Scales here. In Row Kanok. One of leader. Help protect many. Also strong. Baeshra know how hunt much. But also protect. Hard know how Shiny Scales feel.\" Baeshra looks up to the stars. \"Baeshra be asked before... but now Baeshra ask... What you see up there?\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T09:37:44.455000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742315742011195393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
